[ 1. OUR COMMITMENT TO PRIVACY ]
================================================================================

The App is built on a "Local-First" principle. We do not collect, transmit, or
share your personal content. Audio files, media metadata, album artwork,
embedded lyrics, generated images, app language preferences, and theme settings
are processed and stored strictly on your local device.

Internet connectivity is used *exclusively* for optional application software
updates (including signature verification) and for loading the public
HeheJuice avatars shown in the credits screen. It is never required for core
functionality such as generating lyric cards or theme customization.

---

[ 2. LOCAL DATA STORAGE & HANDLING ]
================================================================================

All data remains within your device's private storage directories:

  * Media Metadata & Lyrics Processing
    When you select an audio file, the App uses Android's native system APIs
    and its own zero-dependency byte parsing to read the file locally. It
    extracts the title, artist, duration, album artwork, and any embedded
    lyrics (e.g., ID3v2 USLT frames or Vorbis Comments). This data is processed
    in memory or cached locally to render the lyric cards. No third-party
    audio parsing libraries are used.

  * Cached Music State (Last Selected Song)
    To provide a seamless experience, the App caches the metadata (title,
    artist, duration, and lyrics) of the last selected song, along with a copy
    of its album artwork, into your device's private storage. This allows the
    App to instantly restore your last session upon restarting.
    Storage locations:
      - SharedPreferences: music_cache
      - Internal Storage: filesDir/cached_album_art.png
    You can clear this cache at any time by clearing the App's data.

  * Generated Images
    The images (cards) you generate are saved to the location you choose via
    Android's Storage Access Framework (SAF). The App does not upload these
    images to any server.

  * App-Level Preferences
    Onboarding state (whether the welcome screen has been acknowledged) and
    UI settings (such as lyric time tags and app watermark preferences) are
    stored locally in:
    app_prefs

  * App Language Preference
    If you select a specific display language from the App's language picker,
    the chosen language tag is stored by the AndroidX AppCompat library in its
    internal per-app locale record. This is required to restore the language
    on the next launch.

  * Cached Update Files
    Downloaded update packages are stored temporarily in:
    cacheDir/app-release.apk
    This file is used only for user-initiated installation of an update.

  * Cached GitHub Avatars
    Public GitHub avatars for the credits screen are cached locally in the
    App's cache directory. These are used only for the credits section.

---

[ 3. NETWORK ACCESS & APP UPDATES ]
================================================================================

  * Purpose of Internet Permission
    The App connects to the internet solely to check for, verify, and download
    application update packages from the project's GitHub Releases page
    (api.github.com and github.com), and to load public GitHub avatars.

  * Complete User Control
    Network access is entirely optional. You can disable internet permissions
    for the App at any time via your device settings, or use the App
    completely offline without affecting card generation.

  * Zero Personal Data Transmitted
    Update checks send only standard version-related requests. Your media
    files, lyrics, generated images, and personal data are never transmitted
    to any server.

  * Signature Verification
    Before checking for updates, the App verifies its own digital signature
    against the official release certificate SHA-256:
    bbd053c0a67dbfc7938a3086d13325bfa212d550d6e6cbf39e48edf6b52bfc0d
    This ensures you are running an authentic, untampered version.

---

[ 4. DATA TRANSMISSION & THIRD-PARTY ACCESS ]
================================================================================

  * No Sharing
    Your media files, extracted lyrics, and generated images never leave your
    physical device.

  * No Analytics or Tracking
    The App contains no third-party tracking SDKs, advertising networks, or
    behavioral telemetry services. We do not monitor how you use the App.

  * No Advertising
    The App does not display ads and does not use advertising identifiers.

---

[ 5. DEVICE PERMISSIONS & SYSTEM INTEGRATION ]
================================================================================

The App requests native Android permissions and special access only when
strictly necessary:

  * Read Media Audio / SAF
    Required to read the audio files you explicitly select to extract metadata
    and lyrics. The App does not scan your entire audio library; it only
    accesses the specific files you choose.

  * Internet Access
    Used exclusively for optional update checks, APK downloads, and signature
    verification. Can be restricted or disabled without breaking offline core
    functionality.

  * Install Unknown Apps / Request Install Packages
    Used only when you choose to download and install an update. The App shares
    the downloaded APK with the system package installer via FileProvider.

---

[ 6. DATA RETENTION & DELETION ]
================================================================================

  * User Control
    You may clear the App's cache or clear all App data at any time through
    Android System Settings or the App's own settings.

  * Permanent Deletion
    Clearing App data or uninstalling the App permanently removes all stored
    preferences, cached APK files, cached avatar images, and the cached music
    metadata & album artwork from your device.

  * No Server-Side Data
    The App does not create accounts, does not upload user data, and does not
    maintain any server-side profile or backup.

